 "words": 165,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "The rich men came in their fine clothes",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 1.92,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Their purses heavy, their noses high",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 2.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "They dropped their silver in the treasury",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.98,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And made sure everyone saw it fly",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.87,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Then came a widow, thin and gray",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.88,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Two copper coins in her worn hand",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "She dropped them in without a sound",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 1.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "And no one there would understand",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "This poor widow has put in more than all the others",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "For they all gave out of their abundance",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But she, out of her poverty, put in everything she owned",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "All she had to live on",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Jesus sat down across the way",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.88,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And watched the people as they gave",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.93,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "He saw the coins that no one heard",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He saw the faith that makes us brave",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "This poor widow has put in more than all the others",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
